{"id":"word:hebrew:H7523","type":"word","title":"רָצַח","subtitle":"H7523 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, to dash in pieces, i.e. kill (a human being), especially to murder","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to רָצַח (H7523) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 47 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"רָצַח (râtsach) means properly, to dash in pieces, i.e. kill (a human being), especially to murder First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 21 19."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"רָצַח","transliteration":"râtsach","pronunciation":"raw-tsakh'","strong":"H7523","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7523","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["הָ/רֹצֵ֔חַ","הָ/רֹצֵ֑חַ","רֹצֵ֣חַֽ","הָ/רֹצֵֽחַ","רוֹצֵ֗חַ"],"morphs":[["HTd/Vqrmsa",21],["HVqrmsa",10],["HVqi3ms",2],["HVqi2ms",2],["HVpi3mp",2],["HTi/Vqp2ms",1],["HTd/Vprmsa",1],["HC/Vqq3ms/Sp3ms",1],["HC/Vqa",1],["HVprmpa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, to dash in pieces, i.e. kill (a human being), especially to murder","usage":"put to death, kill, (man-) slay(-er), murder(-er).","full":"H7523. ratsach רָצַח verb murder, slay (Late Hebrew (rare, also in derivatives) = Biblical Hebrew; compare Arabic , break, bruise, crush ); — Qal Perfect 3masculine singular consecutive ׳וְר Num 35:27 , וּרְצָחוֺ Deut 22:26 ; 2 masculine singular (הֲ)רָצַחְתָּ 1Kin 21:19 ; Imperfect 3masculine singular יִרְצַח Num 35:30 ; Deut 4:42 ; 2 masculine singular (צ־ַחׅ תִּרְצָ֑ח Exod 20:13 = Deut 5:17 ; Infinitive absolute רָצֹהַּ Hosea 4:2 ; Jer 7:9 ; Participle active רֹצֵחַ Deut 19:3 +, ׳רוֺ 4:42 +; — murder, slay , with premeditation, Exod 20:13 (E) = Deut 5:17 ; Hosea 4:2 ; Jer 7:9 ; 1Kin 21:19 (all absolute); with accusative of person Deut 22:26 , unawares 4:42 ; slay as avenger Num 35:27 , 30 (P; || חֵמִית 35:19 ; 35:21 ); especially participle as substantive = slayer, manslayer , without intent, Deut 4:42 ; 19:3-4 , 6 ; also in P: Num 35:6 , 11 , 12 , 25 , 26 , 27 , 28 ; Josh 20:3 , 5 , 6 ; 21:13 , 21 , 27 , 32 , 26 (van d. H., Baer, 21:38 Gi; all P); murderer , with intent, Num 35:16 (twice in verse); 35:17 (twice in verse); 35:18 (twice in verse); 35:19 , 21 (twice in verse); 35:30 ; Numbers 30:31; also Job 24:14 . Niph`al Imperfect 1singular אֵרָצֵחַ Prov 22:13 I shall be slain; Participle feminine singular as adjective הַנִּרְצָחָה אִשָּׁה Judg 20:4 the murdered woman. Pi`el (intensive) murder, assassinate: 3masculine plural יְרַצְּחוּ Hosea 6:9 (absolute), יְרַצֵּ֑חוּ Psa 94:6 (accusative of person, || הָרַג ); 62:4 see below; Participle מְרַצֵּחַ , as substantive 2Kin 6:32 murderer, assassin ; plural מְרֵצְּחִים Isa 1:21 assassins. Pu`al Imperfect , 2 masculine plural תְּרָצְּחוּ Psa 62:4 , so Baer Gi, van d. H. תְּרָצְחוּ , but Ben Naphtali Pi`el תְּרַצְּחוּ (Baer 143 ), so Vrss Hup-Now De Che Bae and others ye murder (or batter, shatter ).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 21 19","keyReferences":["1Kgs 21 19","2Kgs 6 32","Deut 4 42","Deut 4 42","Deut 5 17","Deut 19 3","Deut 19 4","Deut 19 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":47,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 21 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הֲ/רָצַ֖חְתָּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTi/Vqp2ms"},{"reference":"2Kgs 6 32","book":"2Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַֽ/מְרַצֵּ֤חַ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vprmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 4 42","book":"Deut","chapter":4,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רוֹצֵ֗חַ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 4 42","book":"Deut","chapter":4,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִרְצַ֤ח","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3ms"},{"reference":"Deut 5 17","book":"Deut","chapter":5,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תִּרְצָֽח","source":